## Binaries in the archive

| Binary | Target |
| --- | --- |
| `raptor` | 68060 with FPU (recommended) |
| `raptor_nofpu` | 68060 / 68EC060 / 68LC060 soft-float |
| `raptor_030_fpu` | 68030 with an external 68881/68882 FPU |
| `raptor_030` | 68030 soft-float |

All four are native m68k AmigaOS executables. See `MANIFEST.txt` for the
exact source commit and SHA-256 values of the binaries in this package.

## Required game data

The archive does **not** contain the original game data. Copy
`FILE0000.GLB` through `FILE0004.GLB` from a legally owned copy of the
**full PC v1.2** release into the game drawer. The port does not run
without them. Music files (`MP3/` or `WAVE/`) and the savegame drawer are
provided by the player; see `Raptor/ReadMe` inside the archive.

